I've received several posts describing my account of how I'm not raising my
kids as "bizarre," "crytic," etc.  I intended to pose a riddle; apparently
not everyone figured it out.  Here are the clues again:

>I think I probably have a lot of kids, but I'm not sure.  I don't know
